===================================================
    
1-1. FLOAT + FLOAT => FLOAT     

===================================================
cast(2 as float)+ cast(1.1 as float)    typeof( cast(2 as float)+ cast(1.1 as float))    
3.1     float     

===================================================
    
1-2. FLOAT + DOUBLE => DOUBLE     

===================================================
cast(2 as float)+ cast(1.1 as double)    typeof( cast(2 as float)+ cast(1.1 as double))    
3.1     double     

===================================================
    
2-1. DOUBLE + DOUBLE => DOUBLE     

===================================================
cast(2 as double)+ cast(1.1 as double)    typeof( cast(2 as double)+ cast(1.1 as double))    
3.1     double     

